og","breadcrumbAria":"Breadcrumb","emptyBefore":"No posts in this category yet — we're writing them. Browse the full","emptyLink":"blog","emptyAfter":"in the meantime.","tocHeading":"In this article","tocAriaLabel":"Article table of contents","faqShort":"FAQ","faqHeading":"Frequently asked questions","minShort":"{count} min","minRead":"{count} min read","featured":"Featured","keepReading":"Keep reading","ctaTitle":"Recognize your business in this?","ctaBody":"We've probably seen the pattern before. Tell us what hurts — the diagnosis is on us.","ctaButton":"Let's talk","heroAltDiscover":"Discover — data signals coming into focus out of darkness","heroAltDiagnose":"Diagnose — scattered data resolving into one clear signal","heroAltDesign":"Design — luminous wireframe architecture assembling","heroAltDeliver":"Deliver — streams of light in motion, building and shipping","heroAltEvolve":"Evolve — an organic network of light growing upward"},"checks":{"seoMetaTitle":"Free SEO & Speed Check — Real PageSpeed Scores | WeEvolveIT","seoMetaDescription":"Test your website's speed and SEO health free — real Google PageSpeed scores plus Core Web Vitals. Get a step-by-step plan to rank higher.","seoEyebrow":"Free SEO & speed check","seoHeroTitle":"Test your site's speed & SEO health.","seoHeroLead":"Enter your URL for a real Google PageSpeed analysis — Performance, SEO, Accessibility, and Core Web Vitals. Free, with no signup to see your score. Want a plan to fix what's holding your rankings back? Leave your email (and WhatsApp for a faster reply) and we'll send it over.","seoFooterText":"Professional SEO + GEO/AEO by WeEvolveIT —","seoFooterLink":"see how we rank you on Google and get you cited by AI","seoUrlAria":"Your website URL","seoStrategyMobile":"Mobile","seoStrategyDesktop":"Desktop","seoSubmitTest":"Test my site","seoSubmitTesting":"Testing…","seoLoading":"Running a real Google PageSpeed analysis — this takes ~10–30 seconds…","seoWait0":"Almost there…","seoWait1":"Hang 